{#- About page (REQ-012, REQ-016; plan D-12, A-04), in this order: the
    hero-style title; the approach as the trust points, with a labelled card
    linking the "how this site was built" article as the approach in practice
    (founder call 2026-09-21: it replaced the GRC-fork note of A-04); the
    mission section with the founding month; the contact band. The mission is
    two first-person paragraphs, placed after the approach, by founder call
    2026-09-23 (it replaced the company-voice mission of the 2026-09-22 call).
    Still no founder section: only the lead names the founder, in its first
    sentence (founder request 2026-09-23), and the landing page's trust
    section carries the name too. Section backgrounds alternate by position:
    plain, section-alt, then the plain contact band. Every string comes from
    strings[lang].about, so both languages render this one body:
    src/en/about.njk and src/sv/about.njk hold only their front matter and
    the line that includes it. -#}
{%- set about = strings[lang].about -%}
{%- set heroEyebrow = about.eyebrow -%}
{%- set heroTitle = about.title -%}
{%- set heroLead = about.lead -%}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}
<section class="section about-approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="container trust-grid">
    <div class="trust-copy reveal">
      <h2 id="approach-title">{{ about.approachHeading }}</h2>
    </div>
    <dl class="trust-points">
      {%- for key in ["aiNative", "team", "open", "proof"] %}
      <div class="trust-point reveal">
        <dt>{{ about.points[key].title }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ about.points[key].text }}</dd>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </dl>
    <aside class="card note reveal" aria-labelledby="article-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ about.article.label }}</p>
      <h3 id="article-title">{{ about.article.title }}</h3>
      <p class="note-text">{{ about.article.text }}</p>
      <a class="app-action" href="{{ langPrefix }}/blog/how-this-site-was-built-by-agents/">{{ about.article.link }}<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-alt about-mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
  <div class="container trust-grid">
    <div class="trust-copy reveal">
      <h2 id="mission-title">{{ about.missionHeading }}</h2>
      <p class="facts-line">{{ about.facts }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-lead">{{ about.missionText }}</p>
      <p class="section-lead">{{ about.missionTextSecond }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/home/contact.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
